Friend,

I think my opponent's campaign might be a little bit
nervous.

After you helped outraise them last fundraising deadline,
they've been on the attack -- slinging mud at me and trying to tear
down the movement we're building together.

I'm tough. I can take the attacks.

But this week I'm facing something I can't take on myself --
Sunday night is our next important fundraising deadline and
we need to raise $100,000 before midnight to prove that my
opponent's attacks aren't changing minds.

Will you donate $5 to help me hit that goal -- and prove Ken
Cuccinelli's attacks just won't stick?

http://action.terrymcauliffe.com/prove-him-wrong

My opponent's campaign is throwing attack after attack so
that everyone's too distracted to take a real look at his
record.

That's a smart strategy -- if you don't think you can win on
the issues.

But I know Virginia voters are smarter. And I have no doubt
we'll come out on top on Election Day because they'll see
the very clear contrast on education, transportation, and
women's health care -- and they want a Governor who'll put
jobs first.

Let's show Ken Cuccinelli that we see through his attacks --
and together we're going to make sure voters do too. Donate
$5 to help us raise $100,000 before Sunday's fundraising
deadline:

http://action.terrymcauliffe.com/prove-him-wrong

Thank you,

Terry



DONATE: http://action.terrymcauliffe.com/prove-him-wrong



---
Paid for by Terry McAuliffe for Governor
---

